/*!
\page page_sthltbtofhit StHltBTofHit

\brief HLT Barrel Time-of-Flight (BTOF) detector hit with timing and channel information.

\section overview Overview

`StHltBTofHit` stores timing and channel information for a single BTOF hit recorded by the HLT.
The BTOF system has 120 trays of MRPC modules arranged around the TPC. The raw TDC time is
corrected for slewing via the time-over-threshold (TOT), yielding the calibrated TOF. Together
with path length from \ref StHltTrackNode, it enables particle identification via β = L/(c·tof).

\section hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StHltBTofHit
\endcode

\section datamembers Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `short` | `mTrayId` | BTOF tray identifier (1–120) |
| `short` | `mChannel` | Encoded channel: nModule×6 + nCell |
| `float` | `mTdc` | Raw TDC time (ns) |
| `float` | `mTot` | Time-over-threshold (ns); used for slewing correction |
| `float` | `mTof` | Calibrated time-of-flight (ns) |
| `float` | `mTriggerTime` | Trigger reference time (ns) |
| *(StLink)* | `mTrackNode` | Parent track node |

\section keymethods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `short trayId() const` | BTOF tray (1–120) |
| `short channel() const` | Encoded channel index |
| `int module() const` | Module index (channel/6) |
| `int cell() const` | Cell index (channel%6) |
| `float tdc() const` | Raw TDC time (ns) |
| `float tot() const` | Time-over-threshold (ns) |
| `float tof() const` | Calibrated time-of-flight (ns) |
| `float triggerTime() const` | Trigger reference time (ns) |
| `StHltTrackNode* trackNode() const` | Parent track node |

\section example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StSPtrVecHltBTofHit& hits = hlt->bTofHit();
for (size_t i = 0; i < hits.size(); ++i)
    cout << "tof=" << hits[i]->tof() << " ns" << endl;
\endcode

\see StHltEvent
\see StHltTrackNode
\see StHltVpdHit
*/
